// Copy this file to wifi_credentials_local.hpp (gitignored -- see .gitignore
// and wifi_credentials.cpp) and fill in your real Wi-Fi network credentials.
//
// This Wi-Fi connection is used purely as a one-shot SNTP time source at
// boot (see sntp_time_provider.hpp) -- it is never a runtime dependency for
// anything else. Leaving these as empty strings still builds and runs: the
// dial works exactly as it does today, just without authenticated commands
// succeeding (SntpTimeProvider will fail to associate and time stays
// unavailable, which the UI shows as "NO TIME").

